            "created_at": 1750420914,
            "pk": "18000918389789697",
            "text": "Accelerate your startup to Dubai: deadline extended till June 30\n\nWe extend the deadline for IT companies from Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan to apply for the Digital Startups Scale Up. In partnership with @difc_innovationhub and supported by @astana.hub and @itpark_uz @startupbase.uz, the hub is opening doors for Central Asian founders. \n\n📈Why apply?\nExport is the next step, and if your startup is already growing well in the home country, it is time to look at promising markets. While MENA is one of the richest and fastest-growing regions in terms of IT, where projects from Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan can promote their expertise.\n\n✅To be considered for participation, startups should have sustainable traction in the country of residence, be prepared to localize the team and product for the UAE and MENA market and be able to relocate a founder or co-founder to the UAE for the full 8-week duration of the program\n\n📆The acceleration program will run from mid-September to mid-November 2025.\n\nApplication is available at the link in bio. \nDeadline: June 30"
